{
  "about": "A Pane alone in its column moves with it, its ID and its width; one in a stack leaves it for a new column, or changes places in it, counted as if it had left. Dropped between workspaces, a Pane makes one there, never under the empty one. A Pane's height is its column's, so it leaves it there.",
